@startuml
title Figura 16 - Infraestructura Regional: LB + HA Patroni/Sentinel + Data Planes

actor "Usuario Final\nInternet" as User
participant "DNS\nRoute53 / Cloudflare" as DNS
participant "Global LB\nAWS Global Accelerator\n/ Cloudflare Load Balancer" as GLB
participant "Control Plane\nGlobal" as CP

== REGIÓN 1 - BOGOTÁ (PRIMARY ACTIVE) ==
participant "API Pods x3\nFlask + Gunicorn" as API1
participant "Socket.IO x3\nEventlet" as WS1
participant "Celery x4\nWorkers + Beat" as CELERY1
database "PG Primary\nPatroni Leader" as PG1
database "Redis Sentinel\nMaster + 2 Replicas" as REDIS1
participant "MinIO x4\nErasure Coding" as MINIO1

== REGIÓN 2 - MEDELLÍN (STANDBY) ==
participant "API Pods x2" as API2
participant "Socket.IO x2" as WS2
participant "Celery x2" as CELERY2
database "PG Replica\nPatroni Follower" as PG2
database "Redis Sentinel\nRead Replicas" as REDIS2
participant "MinIO x4" as MINIO2

== REGIÓN 3 - CALI (STANDBY) ==
participant "API Pods x2" as API3
participant "Socket.IO x2" as WS3
participant "Celery x2" as CELERY3
database "PG Replica\nPatroni Follower" as PG3
database "Redis Sentinel\nRead Replicas" as REDIS3
participant "MinIO x4" as MINIO3

== CONTROL PLANE GLOBAL ==
participant "Feature Flags\nPostgreSQL table" as FLAGS
participant "Service Mesh\nIstio / Linkerd" as MESH
participant "Observability\nPrometheus + Grafana\nLoki + Tempo" as OBS
participant "Secrets\nVault / AWS Secrets" as SECRETS
participant "CI/CD\nArgoCD / Flux\nGitOps" as CICD

User -> DNS: Resuelve chambeapp.com
DNS -> GLB: Anycast IP + Health checks
GLB -> API1: Tráfico 100% (Región 1 Healthy)
GLB -x API2: Standby (Solo sync)
GLB -x API3: Standby (Solo sync)

CP -> API1: Config + Deploy + Flags
CP -> API2: Config + Sync + Promote
CP -> API3: Config + Sync

API1 -> CP: Métricas + Health + Logs + Traces
API2 -> CP: Replication Lag + Status
API3 -> CP: Replication Lag + Status

PG1 -> PG2: Replicación Async\nPatroni (RPO ~1-5s)
PG1 -> PG3: Replicación Async\nPatroni (RPO ~1-5s)
REDIS1 -> REDIS2: Sentinel Replication
REDIS1 -> REDIS3: Sentinel Replication
MINIO1 -> MINIO2: Cross-region Replication
MINIO1 -> MINIO3: Cross-region Replication

note right of GLB
  HEALTH CHECKS GLOBALES:
  • /health cada 10s por región
  • Patroni /master endpoint
  • Redis Sentinel master check
  • MinIO health endpoint
  
  FAILOVER < 60s:
  1. GLB detecta región unhealthy
  2. Promueve réplica a primary (Patroni)
  3. Actualiza DNS (TTL 30s)
  4. Redirige tráfico a región standby
  5. Notifica on-call (PagerDuty)
end note

note right of PG1
  PATRONI MULTI-REGIÓN:
  • Leader election: etcd/Consul
  • Sync replication: RPO=0 (local)
  • Async replication: RPO~5s (cross-region)
  • pgBackRest: S3/MinIO backup
  • PITR: Point-in-time recovery
  • Switchover manual: < 30s
end note

note right of REDIS1
  REDIS SENTINEL:
  • 3 Sentinels por región
  • Master + 2 Replicas
  • Auto-failover local
  • Pub/Sub para Socket.IO
  • Celery broker HA
end note

note right of MINIO1
  MINIO MULTI-REGIÓN:
  • 4 nodos por región
  • Erasure coding (data:parity=2:1)
  • Replicación async cross-region
  • Versioning + Object Lock (WORM)
  • Gateway S3 compatible
end note

@enduml